      "text": "This 8-day trip takes you through central Costa Rica, the Arenal Volcano area and the southern Pacific coast. Visit the Doka coffee plantation, Poás Volcano, La Paz Waterfalls and the Caño Negro Wildlife Refuge. The route also includes hanging bridges and a canopy tour near Arenal, the Tárcoles River, Manuel Antonio National Park and a boat trip in Marino Ballena.",
